# Personal memory data dumps (names, places, dated events) live in this dir and
# must never be tracked. The dir holds both shareable tooling and private data,
# so the policy is a whitelist: track only code and its docs, ignore everything
# else, data dumps included. This moved the "never track the dumps" guarantee out
# of a local-only .git/info/exclude and into the repo, where it holds for clones.
*
!.gitignore
!*.py
!*.md
